# Contributing

- Commits + PR titles: [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/). Same format both. Scope when area clear (`workout`, `deps`, `ui`).
- PR: focused diff. CI green before review. Squash use PR title as commit — title matter.
- No secrets, `.env`, credentials in git.
- Code style: `.cursor/rules/coding-standards.mdc`.
